    "5": "Every original ordered proof name and complete helper/body/caller/functional/flow/RTE/termination coverage remains mandatory. Both private Compress helpers are additively enrolled; manifest functions/floor/sole boundary are exact, with no proof acceptance or deadline efficacy.",
